Package: CompetingRiskRPackage
Title: Competing Risks Diagnostics for Case-Cohort Studies
Version: 0.3.7
Authors@R: 
    person("Yang", "Ruan", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Fits weighted proportional subdistribution hazards models for
    case-cohort data with competing risks. Provides sandwich covariance estimates,
    event-indexed residuals, correlation diagnostics and nuisance-adjusted score
    tests for time-varying effects, with censoring and subcohort corrections.
